# Skills under .claude/skills/ come from two sources:
#   • `npx skills add`  — tracked in skills-lock.json, restored by the CLI → NOT committed
#   • OpenSpec (`openspec init/update`) — no lockfile → committed:
#     links to the skills themselves, which live in .agents/skills/
# So: ignore all skills, then re-include the OpenSpec-generated links (openspec-* prefix).
/skills/*
!/skills/openspec-*

# Local-only Claude Code settings (per-machine permissions, etc.) — never share.
/settings.local.json

# Runtime state written by the harness (scheduled tasks, etc.) — never commit.
/*.lock

# Agents' worktrees for planning several changes at once — never commit.
/worktrees/
